     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_shalvat_sdom",
     "gloss_en": "R' Avin: and its [Sodom's] tranquility was twenty-six [years]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.11a.5",
   "sugya": "shabbat_11a_chalalah_shel_reshut",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_mai_kraah_lev_melachim",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מאי קראה? אמר רב משרשיא: שמים לרום וארץ לעומק ולב מלכים אין חקר",
     "supports": "p_ein_maspikin_chalalah_shel_reshut",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ein_maspikin_chalalah_shel_reshut",
     "gloss_en": "Rav: if all the seas were ink, the reeds quills, the heavens parchment, and all people scribes -- they would not suffice to write the expanse of reshut"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.11a.2",
   "sugya": "shabbat_11a_gagot_gvohot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_shenemar_lerommem",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "שנאמר: לרומם את בית אלהינו ולהעמיד את חרבותיו",
     "supports": "p_ir_gagoteha_gvohin_charevah",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_veha_charva",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והא חרבה! -- but Mata Mechasya was destroyed",
     "against": "p_rav_ashi_mata_mechasya",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_meoto_avon_lo_charva",
     "gloss_en": "מאותו עון לא חרבה -- it was not destroyed for that sin",
     "answers": "obj_veha_charva",
     "restores": "p_rav_ashi_mata_mechasya"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ir_gagoteha_gvohin_charevah",
     "gloss_en": "Rav: any city whose roofs are higher than the synagogue will in the end be destroyed"
    }
   ]
  },
