     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ואמר רבא בר מחסיא אמר רב חמא בר גוריא אמר רב: יפה תענית לחלום כאש לנעורת",
     "supports": "p_taanit_chalom_hu",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_bo_bayom_hachalom",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ואמר רב חסדא: ובו ביום",
     "supports": "p_taanit_chalom_hu",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_afilu_beshabbat",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ואמר רב יוסף: אפילו בשבת",
     "supports": "p_taanit_chalom_hu",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_loveh_adam_taanito",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "(they had prepared a third-grown calf: לטעום מר מידי) ולא סבר לה מר להא דרב יהודה? דאמר רב יהודה: לוה אדם תעניתו ופורע -- does the master not hold Rav Yehuda's dictum, that a person borrows his fast and repays it? (kind svara: no ObjectionKind for an amoraic memra)",
     "against": "p_yoshev_betaanit",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_taanit_chalom_hu",
     "gloss_en": "תענית חלום הוא -- it is a dream fast (= p_taanit_chalom_hu)",
     "answers": "obj_loveh_adam_taanito",
     "restores": "p_yoshev_betaanit"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_yoshev_betaanit",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Yehoshua breih deRav Idi: I am sitting in a fast"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.11a.6",
   "sugya": "shabbat_11a_taanit_chalom",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_yafa_taanit_lachalom",
     "gloss_en": "a fast is good for a dream as fire is for chaff"
    }
   ]
  },
